AltoMintMarket::setDusdOracle()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketUnauthorized
├── when _dusdOracle is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoMintMarketInvalidInput
└── when all conditions are met for valid update
    ├── it should emit SetDusdOracle event with old and new oracle addresses
    └── it should update dusdOracle state variable to new address
